  "term": "collective",
  "definition": "In this context, collective refers to experiences or psychological states that arise at the level of a group rather than a single person. It describes phenomena shaped by shared goals, coordinated interaction, mutual trust, and common emotional uplift or self-transcendence in communal settings.",
